[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12960.389, "timestamp": "03:36:00", "text": "可以看到人们一直以来所做的事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12962.63, "timestamp": "03:36:02", "text": "正在输入。即使你禁止它们，你仍然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12964.55, "timestamp": "03:36:04", "text": "就像收集了一些东西，比如什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12967.67, "timestamp": "03:36:07", "text": "他们说过。嗯，甚至还有类似的片段"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12970.07, "timestamp": "03:36:10", "text": "还有一些其他的东西，他们有类似……那是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12972.71, "timestamp": "03:36:12", "text": "叫什么？就像对所有人的总结"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12975.429, "timestamp": "03:36:15", "text": "比如捐赠之类的东西。这是第一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12977.349, "timestamp": "03:36:17", "text": "我听说有人这么做过好几次了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12979.75, "timestamp": "03:36:19", "text": "立刻就喜欢上了Discord。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12981.91, "timestamp": "03:36:21", "text": "有趣的。那它就完事了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12983.67, "timestamp": "03:36:23", "text": "这样对你来说更容易处理一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12985.99, "timestamp": "03:36:25", "text": "然后？像处理所有这些一样处理"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12989.83, "timestamp": "03:36:29", "text": "多层。嗯。嗯，我感觉是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12995.269, "timestamp": "03:36:35", "text": "比如，这有助于保持"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12997.51, "timestamp": "03:36:37", "text": "跟踪消息和点赞的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12999.99, "timestamp": "03:36:39", "text": "比如有人向我推荐了一款游戏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13004.309, "timestamp": "03:36:44", "text": "某物。嗯，所以有什么重要的事吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13007.11, "timestamp": "03:36:47", "text": "我把它忘了。我随时可以回去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13009.269, "timestamp": "03:36:49", "text": "然后查看聊天记录，就像这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13012.87, "timestamp": "03:36:52", "text": "那。我以前……呃，因为我……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13015.03, "timestamp": "03:36:55", "text": "以前我会感谢每一位观众。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13017.67, "timestamp": "03:36:57", "text": "谁来溪边玩了之类的。所